<?xml version="1.0"?><iai friendlyname="Kids - Life cycle of a mushroom" id="0017081a" height="411" width="574" hasaudio="0" hascredits="0" lang="E" basecontroltype="SlideShowControl" outlinecolorid="1" skinstyle="kidsGray" skinlib="kids1"><slides><slide type="standard" sequence="1" slideid="1"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="1" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Los hongos se reproducen mediante la formación de unas semillas muy pequeñas denominadas esporas. Hay dos tipos de esporas: espora + y espora -. Cuando las esporas caen en un lugar con humedad y comida suficientes, germinan y forman un pequeño tubo o filamento que recibe el nombre de hifa. El filamento está formado por varias células que se sitúan una a continuación de otra.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Germinación&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>0017081a_1.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="65" y="14"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-6</x><y>105</y></point></points><origin><x>61</x><y>24</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Espora +&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>1</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Espora +&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="61" y="15" w="67" h="17"/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="80" y="33"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-6</x><y>85</y></point></points><origin><x>76</x><y>43</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Espora -&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>1</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Espora -&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="76" y="34" w="64" h="17"/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="261" y="21"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Hifa&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>1</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Hifa&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="257" y="22" w="37" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Germinación&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" slideid="2" sequence="2"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Las hifas crecen y se dividen, formando una red de hifas debajo del suelo que recibe el nombre de micelio.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Crecimiento de la hifa&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>0017081a_2.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="251" y="18"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Micelio&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>2</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Micelio&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Crecimiento de la hifa&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" slideid="3" sequence="3"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Dos hifas pertenecientes al mismo micelio o, más frecuentemente, a micelios distintos se unen para formar un nuevo micelio, que contiene dos núcleos, uno procedente de una hifa y el otro de la otra.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Unión de las hifas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>0017081a_3.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="190" y="8"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Hifa con un núcleo&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>3</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Hifa con un núcleo&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="53" y="26"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Hifa con dos núcleos&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>3</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Hifa con dos núcleos&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Unión de las hifas&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" slideid="4" sequence="4"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Cuando las condiciones ambientales son adecuadas, el micelio forma el cuerpo fructífero o la seta, que es la encargada de producir las esporas. La seta es algo parecido al fruto del hongo.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Formación de la seta&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>0017081a_4.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="287" y="319"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>6</x><y>-27</y></point></points><origin><x>339</x><y>329</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Micelio&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>4</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Micelio&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="283" y="48"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>6</x><y>51</y></point></points><origin><x>353</x><y>58</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Sombrero&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>4</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Sombrero&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="153" y="99"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>42</x><y>36</y></point></points><origin><x>225</x><y>109</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Laminillas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>4</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Laminillas&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Formación de la seta&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" slideid="5" sequence="5"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Las esporas se dispersan por el viento y el ciclo reproductor se inicia de nuevo.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Liberación de las esporas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>0017081a_5.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="220" y="15"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>6</x><y>27</y></point></points><origin><x>254</x><y>25</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Seta&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>5</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Seta&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="82" y="124"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>42</x><y>36</y></point></points><origin><x>138</x><y>134</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Esporas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>5</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Esporas&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Liberación de las esporas&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide></slides><slideshowcontrol bottombarbgcolorid="4" 